msgstr "Tu as fouillé comme cochon qui cherche des truffes..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/the_strip_club/0/g-1/c-8/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And handed gift card to Applekeys, for four dollars and fifty cents, to hard-working lady who has given us a dance that shook us to our very foundations?"
msgstr "Et tu as tendu une carte cadeau Applekeys de quatre dollars et cinquante cents à travailleuse acharnée qui nous a offert une danse qui nous a ébranlés jusque dans nos fondations ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/the_strip_club/0/g-1/c-8/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This date is now over. Unbelievable. UnBELIEVABLE!"
msgstr "Ce rendez-vous est maintenant terminé. Incroyable. INCROYABLE !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/post_strip_bad/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? Why not?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Pourquoi pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/3
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, you wish to continue going on practice dates with myself?"
msgstr "Ah, tu veux continuer à faire des rendez-vous d'entraînement avec moi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, 'practice dates', Dasha."
msgstr "Ouais, des « rendez-vous d'entraînement », Dasha."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I just needed to get something off the desk."
msgstr "Non, j'avais juste besoin de récupérer un truc sur le bureau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you pick me up?"
msgstr "Tu peux me soulever ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to profess my undying love for you."
msgstr "Je veux te déclarer mon amour éternel."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Here are the potential locations for these dates..."
msgstr "Voici les lieux possibles pour ces rendez-vous..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A restaurant!"
msgstr "Un restaurant !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A strip club..."
msgstr "Un club de strip-tease..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The bowling alley?"
msgstr "Le bowling ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Happy to lend support!"
msgstr "Ravie de te soutenir !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ooop!"
msgstr "Hop !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-2/15 dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-1/18 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You rise far higher in the air than is recommended by most professionals, but Dasha safely puts you down, and thus satisfied, you take your leave."
msgstr "Vous vous élevez dans les airs bien plus haut que ne le recommandent la plupart des professionnels, mais Dasha vous repose sans encombre, et, ainsi {{satisfait|satisfaite|satisfait·e}}, vous prenez congé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/date_chooser/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "For me? Now?"
msgstr "Pour moi ? Maintenant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is very sudden... but perhaps not so surprising."
msgstr "C'est très soudain... mais peut-être pas si surprenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have mastered practice date, after all."
msgstr "Tu maîtrises le rendez-vous d'entraînement, après tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have shown that you are more than ready to sail the seas of love."
msgstr "Tu as montré que tu es plus que {{prêt|prête|prêt·e}} à naviguer sur les mers de l'amour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha, however, is not ready for such a conversation."
msgstr "Dasha, en revanche, n'est pas prête pour une telle conversation."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is much on my mind, and you deserve my mind to be clear."
msgstr "J'ai beaucoup de choses en tête, et tu mérites que j'aie l'esprit clair."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please... come find me again soon, yes?"
msgstr "S'il te plaît... reviens me voir bientôt, oui ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I understand... talk to you soon."
msgstr "Je comprends... à bientôt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "In the meantime, I must clear the confusion and uncertainty from my mind."
msgstr "En attendant, je dois chasser la confusion et l'incertitude de mon esprit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_good_not_ready/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "With LIFT!"
msgstr "En SOULEVANT !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are doing well, make no mistake."
msgstr "Tu t'en sors bien, ne te méprends pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I have not yet felt the romance in our practice dates."
msgstr "Mais je n'ai pas encore senti la romance dans nos rendez-vous d'entraînement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you wish to end now, you are the boss."
msgstr "Si tu veux arrêter maintenant, c'est toi le chef."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But it does not hurt to learn a little more, yes?"
msgstr "Mais ça ne fait pas de mal d'en apprendre un peu plus, oui ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm ready now."
msgstr "Non, je suis {{prêt|prête|prêt·e}} maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, I need more practice."
msgstr "T'as raison, j'ai besoin de plus d'entraînement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Well... you are the boss."
msgstr "Bon... c'est toi le chef."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I am not ready to have this conversation just now."
msgstr "Mais je ne suis pas prête à avoir cette conversation pour l'instant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please, return to me again later."
msgstr "S'il te plaît, reviens me voir plus tard."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. See you again soon, Dasha."
msgstr "D'accord. À bientôt, Dasha."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have much to consider at this moment."
msgstr "J'ai beaucoup de choses à considérer en ce moment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am glad you are still interested in perfecting your approach to romance."
msgstr "Je suis contente que tu tiennes encore à perfectionner ton approche de la romance."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Trust me when I tell you this conversation will not go the way you are hoping."
msgstr "Crois-moi quand je te dis que cette conversation ne se passera pas comme tu l'espères."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A bit more practice is needed."
msgstr "Il faut encore un peu d'entraînement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "<i>Take the practice.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Accepte l'entraînement.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I said what I said."
msgstr "J'ai dit ce que j'ai dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright, I'll take the practice."
msgstr "D'accord, j'accepte l'entraînement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...it is your funeral."
msgstr "... c'est ton enterrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But in any event, I am too busy for such a conversation now."
msgstr "Mais quoi qu'il en soit, je suis trop occupée pour une telle conversation maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. See you soon."
msgstr "D'accord. À bientôt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please choose another time."
msgstr "S'il te plaît, choisis un autre moment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Whew. I am glad to hear it."
msgstr "Pfiou. Je suis contente de l'entendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_low_not_ready/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We have... much work to do."
msgstr "Nous avons... beaucoup de travail."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_critical_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "Hm..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_critical_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Dasha. What's going on?"
msgstr "Salut, Dasha. Qu'est-ce qui se passe ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_critical_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dasha?"
msgstr "Dasha ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah... I am so glad to see you."
msgstr "Ah... Je suis si contente de te voir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is much on my mind lately."
msgstr "J'ai beaucoup de choses en tête, ces temps-ci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/16/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/16/s/0 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/0/s/0 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you want to talk about it?"
msgstr "Tu veux en parler ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "Pas encore."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/c-0/15 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I promised I would help you with date training and we must finish yet."
msgstr "J'ai promis de t'aider à t'entraîner aux rendez-vous, et nous devons encore finir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/c-0/23 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now comes most important part."
msgstr "Maintenant vient la partie la plus importante."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We have had wonderful dates—everything has been so perfect."
msgstr "Nous avons eu de merveilleux rendez-vous : tout a été si parfait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/c-0/39 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/8 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have brought me back to my house, and now we sit in your car."
msgstr "Tu m'as ramenée chez moi, et maintenant nous sommes assis dans ta voiture."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/c-0/47 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/16 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What do you do now?"
msgstr "Que fais-tu maintenant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/24/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I tell you to hurry up and get out 'cause my show is about to come on."
msgstr "Je te dis de te dépêcher de descendre parce que mon émission va commencer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/1/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/25/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I walk you to your door to say good night properly."
msgstr "Je te raccompagne à ta porte pour te souhaiter bonne nuit comme il se doit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/2/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/26/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wait until you've made it safely inside before I drive away."
msgstr "J'attends que tu sois bien rentrée avant de redémarrer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/3/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why are you pointing at me?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tu me montres du doigt ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-1/13 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-1/13 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "NO! You are RUINING atmosphere of romance!"
msgstr "NON ! Tu GÂCHES atmosphère de romance !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-1/24 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-1/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You know better than this!"
msgstr "Tu sais faire mieux que ça !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-1/32 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-1/35 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-2/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You get out and walk me to my door, to ensure I am safe and for MAXIMUM romance!"
msgstr "Tu sors et tu me raccompagnes à ma porte, pour être sûr{{|e|·e}} que je suis en sécurité et pour romance MAXIMALE !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-1/40/b/1 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-1/43/b/1 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-2/40/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We will pretend you did not say this and will walk me to my door like gentleman."
msgstr "Nous allons faire comme si tu n'avais pas dit ça, et tu vas me raccompagner à ma porte comme un gentleman."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-1/43/b/1 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-1/46/b/1 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-2/43/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We will pretend you did not say this and will walk me to my door like gentlewoman."
msgstr "Nous allons faire comme si tu n'avais pas dit ça, et tu vas me raccompagner à ma porte comme une vraie dame."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-1/46/b/1 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-1/49/b/1 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-2/46/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We will pretend you did not say this and will walk me to my door like proper human."
msgstr "Nous allons faire comme si tu n'avais pas dit ça, et tu vas me raccompagner à ma porte comme humain digne de ce nom."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-2/13 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-2/13 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes, just so."
msgstr "Oui, exactement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-2/21 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-2/21 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is better for your date's safety AND extremely romantic."
msgstr "C'est mieux pour la sécurité de ton rencard ET extrêmement romantique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-2/29 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-2/29 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is the way to your date's heart."
msgstr "C'est le chemin vers le coeur de ton rencard."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/13 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-3/13 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is very good, but it is best for friends."
msgstr "C'est très bien, mais c'est plutôt pour les amis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/21 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-3/21 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Since this is romantic date, you should walk your date to their door."
msgstr "Comme c'est rendez-vous romantique, tu devrais raccompagner ton rencard à sa porte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/29 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-3/29 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-4/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps it is a bit old-fashioned now, but it is most romantic."
msgstr "C'est peut-être un peu démodé aujourd'hui, mais c'est le plus romantique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/37 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/c-3/37 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-4/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "So let us assume you have done as I said now and walked me to my door."
msgstr "Alors supposons que tu as fait ce que j'ai dit et que tu m'as raccompagnée à ma porte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/45/0/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now we stand at my door. The air between us is thick with romantic tension."
msgstr "Nous voici devant ma porte. L'air entre nous est chargé de tension romantique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/45/0/8 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/8 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The stars in the sky sparkle only for us."
msgstr "Les étoiles dans le ciel scintillent rien que pour nous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/45/0/16 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you listen, you can almost hear them singing our names."
msgstr "Si tu écoutes bien, tu peux presque les entendre chanter nos noms."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-3/45/0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Daaasha, Daaasha..."
msgstr "Daaasha, Daaasha..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-4/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I sing my name, you sing yours... ack, nevermind."
msgstr "Je chante mon nom, tu chantes le tien... ah, laisse tomber."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is only attempt to paint romantic picture."
msgstr "C'est seulement tentative pour peindre tableau romantique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-0/c-4/23 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Anyway. You understand, yes?"
msgstr "Bref. Tu comprends, oui ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Everything is whispering to you to do one thing to end the date."
msgstr "Tout te murmure de faire une chose pour finir le rendez-vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/16/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/16/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I give you a warm hug and bid you good night."
msgstr "Je te serre chaleureusement dans mes bras et je te souhaite bonne nuit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/17/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/17/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I tell you to hurry up and get inside already."
msgstr "Je te dis de te dépêcher de rentrer, enfin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/18/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/18/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I give you a kiss that curls your toes and steals the breath from your lungs."
msgstr "Je t'embrasse à t'en faire friser les orteils et à te couper le souffle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-5/13 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-5/13 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-5/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh... how wonderful."
msgstr "Oh... comme c'est merveilleux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-5/21 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-5/21 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-5/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Your date may want kiss from you, but is nothing wrong with going at your own pace."
msgstr "Ton rencard voudra peut-être un baiser, mais il n'y a pas de mal à aller à ton rythme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-5/29 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-5/29 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-5/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Very good."
msgstr "Très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-6/13 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-6/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Why ruin the romance!?"
msgstr "Pourquoi gâcher la romance !?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-6/24 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-6/27 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-6/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What is the purpose of coming to my door only to be rude?!"
msgstr "À quoi bon venir jusqu'à ma porte pour être impoli{{|e|·e}} ?!"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-6/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No, no, no. You will NOT say this."
msgstr "Non, non, non. Tu ne diras PAS ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-6/40 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-6/43 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-6/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You will give your date romantic kiss and move your date forward."
msgstr "Tu donneras à ton rencard un baiser romantique et tu feras avancer les choses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "... wow."
msgstr "... ouah."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/21 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/21 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Your date must be very lucky to experience such a thing."
msgstr "Ton rencard doit avoir beaucoup de chance de vivre une telle chose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We should practice, right?"
msgstr "On devrait s'entraîner, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/1/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/1/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anyone kissing you is lucky indeed."
msgstr "Quiconque t'embrasse a vraiment de la chance."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/2/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/2/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "À la réflexion, laisse tomber."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "P-practice?"
msgstr "S-s'entraîner ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/18 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You mean... you, kiss me?"
msgstr "Tu veux dire... toi, m'embrasser ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/23/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you're okay with it, yeah."
msgstr "Si ça te va, ouais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I... yes, that sounds nice."
msgstr "Je... oui, ça me plairait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I mean, ah... anything to help."
msgstr "Enfin, euh... tout pour aider."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha falls silent, closing her eyes as she waits for your kiss. She's shy, but when your lips meet she comes alive, sighing sweetly and leaning into your embrace."
msgstr "Dasha se tait et ferme les yeux en attendant votre baiser. Elle est timide, mais quand vos lèvres se rencontrent, elle s'anime, soupire doucement et se laisse aller dans vos bras."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she pulls away from you she's flushed and just a little dazed."
msgstr "Quand elle s'écarte de vous, elle est toute rouge et un peu étourdie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/c-0/50
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Wow. That was... very good."
msgstr "Ouah. C'était... très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/c-0/68
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is difficult to think after that. But I will manage!"
msgstr "C'est difficile de réfléchir, après ça. Mais je vais y arriver !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/26/c-0/76 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/42
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The date is not yet over!"
msgstr "Le rendez-vous n'est pas encore fini !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, you will make me blush."
msgstr "Ah, tu vas me faire rougir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/15 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-1/15 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No one is kissing Dasha these days... but this is not about me."
msgstr "Personne n'embrasse Dasha ces temps-ci... mais il ne s'agit pas de moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/23 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-1/23 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you are giving your date a kiss they will be very happy."
msgstr "Si tu donnes un baiser à ton rencard, il sera très heureux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/31 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-1/31 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A marvelous choice."
msgstr "Un choix merveilleux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But the date is not yet over."
msgstr "Mais le rendez-vous n'est pas encore fini."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-2/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You do not have to push yourself."
msgstr "Tu n'es pas {{obligé|obligée|obligé·e}} de te forcer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-2/15 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is only practice, after all."
msgstr "Ce n'est qu'un entraînement, après tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We can pretend you have given your date lovely kiss."
msgstr "Nous pouvons faire comme si tu avais donné à ton rencard un joli baiser."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-2/31 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-1/39 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-2/31 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/39 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But the date is not over yet."
msgstr "Mais le rendez-vous n'est pas encore fini."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let us assume your date is not so old-fashioned, and after your kiss has invited you inside."
msgstr "Supposons que ton rencard n'est pas si vieux jeu et qu'après ton baiser, il t'a invité{{|e|·e}} à entrer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/8 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/8 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are accepting this invitation, because date has gone well."
msgstr "Tu acceptes cette invitation, parce que le rendez-vous s'est bien passé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You find yourself sitting on my couch, looking into my eyes."
msgstr "Te voilà {{assis|assise|assis·e}} sur mon canapé, à me regarder dans les yeux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/24 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/24 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What will you do now?"
msgstr "Que vas-tu faire maintenant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/32/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/32/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I ask you if you'd like to go to bed."
msgstr "Je te demande si tu veux aller au lit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/33/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/33/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I put my feet up on your coffee table and tell you to bring me a beer."
msgstr "Je pose mes pieds sur ta table basse et je te dis de m'apporter une bière."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/34/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/34/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I ask you if you'd like to watch a movie and cuddle."
msgstr "Je te demande si tu veux regarder un film en faisant des câlins."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-8/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To bed? T-to sleep?"
msgstr "Au lit ? P-pour dormir ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-8/21/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't think we'll be doing much sleeping."
msgstr "Je crois pas qu'on va beaucoup dormir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...bozhe moi."
msgstr "... bozhe moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you continue to say such things I am afraid I may blast off into space."
msgstr "Si tu continues à dire des choses pareilles, j'ai peur de décoller pour l'espace."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/c-0/26 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-8/21/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I think that is a great place to stop."
msgstr "Je crois que c'est excellent moment pour s'arrêter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-9/13 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-9/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You would ruin beautiful night together with dirty feet on table!?"
msgstr "Tu gâcherais belle soirée ensemble avec des pieds sales sur la table !?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-9/21 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-9/21 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-9/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have heard enough. Date ends here."
msgstr "J'en ai assez entendu. Le rendez-vous s'arrête ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-10/13 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-10/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I would like that very much."
msgstr "Ça me plairait beaucoup."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-10/21 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-10/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What a beautiful end to date."
msgstr "Quelle belle fin de rendez-vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-2/c-10/29 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-10/29 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-10/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have heard enough, I think. Very, very good."
msgstr "J'en ai assez entendu, je crois. Très, très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am so happy to see your smiling face, my friend."
msgstr "Je suis si contente de voir ton visage souriant, camarade."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/8 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is much on my mind lately and I am in need of friendly advice."
msgstr "J'ai beaucoup de choses en tête, ces temps-ci, et j'ai besoin d'un conseil amical."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We have had a wonderful date—everything has been just lovely."
msgstr "Nous avons eu un rendez-vous merveilleux : tout a été tout simplement charmant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Daaaasha... Daaaasha..."
msgstr "Daaaasha... Daaaasha..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She points at herself, and then at you, as though she were expecting something."
msgstr "Elle se montre du doigt, puis vous, comme si elle attendait quelque chose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is only attempt to paint a romantic picture."
msgstr "C'est seulement tentative pour peindre tableau romantique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-6/35 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-6/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No. No, no. You will NOT say this."
msgstr "Non. Non, non. Tu ne diras PAS ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh my, wow."
msgstr "Oh là là, ouah."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Practice?"
msgstr "S'entraîner ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You and I are only on our first date."
msgstr "Toi et moi n'en sommes qu'à notre premier rendez-vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I mean, ah, as your imaginary date."
msgstr "Je veux dire, euh, en tant que ton rendez-vous imaginaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is a bit early in our imaginary relationship, no?"
msgstr "C'est un peu tôt dans notre relation imaginaire, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/34
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But good effort. Anyway..."
msgstr "Mais bel effort. Bref..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/c-7/29/c-2/23 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We can pretend you have given your date a lovely kiss."
msgstr "Nous pouvons faire comme si tu avais donné à ton rencard un joli baiser."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/16 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You find yourself sitting on my couch, looking up into my eyes."
msgstr "Te voilà {{assis|assise|assis·e}} sur mon canapé, à lever les yeux vers les miens."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-8/13 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-8/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To bed? To sleep?"
msgstr "Au lit ? Pour dormir ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-8/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Bozhe moi, you are bold one."
msgstr "Bozhe moi, tu es {{audacieux|audacieuse|audacieux·se}}, toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-3/c-8/21/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We must get to know each other better before such invitations."
msgstr "Nous devons mieux nous connaître avant de telles invitations."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have performed wonderfully."
msgstr "Tu as été merveilleux{{|se|·se}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If I am being honest, I am not sure you ever needed my help."
msgstr "Pour être honnête, je ne suis pas sûre que tu aies jamais eu besoin de mon aide."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Any date would be lucky to have you."
msgstr "N'importe quel rencard aurait de la chance de t'avoir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Take it from me—when you find someone you are ready to date, go for it!"
msgstr "Crois-moi : quand tu trouveras quelqu'un avec qui tu es {{prêt|prête|prêt·e}} à sortir, fonce !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks Dasha. You really were a huge help."
msgstr "Merci, Dasha. Tu m'as vraiment énormément aidé{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is my pleasure. Helping others is my greatest joy."
msgstr "C'est un plaisir. Aider les autres est ma plus grande joie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now it's your turn to let me help you."
msgstr "Maintenant, c'est à ton tour de me laisser t'aider."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's been so wonderful spending time with you."
msgstr "C'était tellement génial de passer du temps avec toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what was up with you before?"
msgstr "Alors, qu'est-ce qui t'arrivait, tout à l'heure ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah... well..."
msgstr "Ah... eh bien..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No buts. What's on your mind?"
msgstr "Pas de mais. Qu'est-ce qui te tracasse ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Eh bien..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please forgive me, but I do not feel ready to share it just yet."
msgstr "Pardonne-moi, mais je ne me sens pas encore prête à en parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I must lift something heavy and make proper sense of all of this."
msgstr "Je dois soulever quelque chose de lourd et mettre de l'ordre dans tout ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/31 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/23 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will... share it with you soon, I promise."
msgstr "Je t'en... parlerai bientôt, promis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/39/0/s/0 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/0/s/0 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll give you some time."
msgstr "Je vais te laisser du temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/39/c-0/7 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/7 dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Thank you. Come see me soon."
msgstr "Merci. Reviens me voir bientôt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And you as well."
msgstr "Toi aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Forgive me for bringing down the mood... but our conversation has made me think of many things."
msgstr "Pardonne-moi de plomber l'ambiance... mais notre conversation m'a fait penser à beaucoup de choses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Promis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Before? Ah... well..."
msgstr "Tout à l'heure ? Ah... eh bien..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please forgive me. Our conversations have given me much to think about."
msgstr "Pardonne-moi. Nos conversations m'ont donné beaucoup à réfléchir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/6
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are in excellent shape to sail the seas of romance."
msgstr "Tu es en excellente forme pour naviguer sur les mers de la romance."

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/14
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I know you will do well..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you alright?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Not yet. Forgive me, but my mind is storm of confusion."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I need time to make sense of it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Only cure for such feelings is lifting many heavy things."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Come back to me another time and I will share my thoughts then."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure. I'll see you later then."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do svidaniya."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/6
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Date training has been disaster."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/17
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I only saw it through because I promised to help you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/25
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And Dasha does not turn her back on those in need."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/33
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But you... you need much help. Much more than Dasha can provide."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/41
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "More help than anyone can provide."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/49
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have never in my life said these words, but you are lost cause."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nooo..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! I love trolling you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Go now and for the love of God do not ask anyone out. I beg of you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah. It is you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...I am fine. I was only thinking of private matter."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I expect you are here to continue date training, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I promised I would help you, and Dasha does not break her promises."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "So let us see this through... even to the bitter end."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tch. Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We have had a terrible night together. One disaster after the other."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And yet, for some reason, hope springs in me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I decide to give you second chance."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are already making me regret second chance!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now we stand at my door. Somehow, even after all that, the air between us is thick with romantic tension."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Some part of me is beginning to think I have judged you too harshly."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are DETERMINED to ruin our date!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh wow, yes. Very good."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Practice? You and I?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You will be kissing me?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am NOT okay with it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This has been the worst imaginary date of my life!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Unfortunately for me, this date is not yet over."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, how kind of you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes, let us move on."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you continue to speak to me this way I will slap you so hard your head will fly from your shoulders at speed of sound."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-8/21/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You must learn to read the room! Even in fake date!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have endured <i>worst</i> fake date one can imagine."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And now, you put dirty feet on my coffee table?!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Cuddling is leap."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps if movie is enjoyable I will scoot closer and hold your hand."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-3/0/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is... unexpected. But."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-3/1/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am surprised. But."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh! There you are."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Dasha. You ready to chat now?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes. Thank you for your patience with me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Spending so much time with you speaking of romance lately..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/23 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It has given me much to think about."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/31 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps it will surprise you that a strong and cheerful desk like myself is not going on many dates these days."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/39 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Truth is, I have put so much of myself into helping others, I have not left much time for myself."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/47 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...no, no, Dasha. Do not lie to this wonderful human."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I thought it would sound nicer if this were the case, but it is not so."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/8/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But- but, the kiss we shared, it was real."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/9/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But the feelings I have for you are real."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel for you too, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Interesting... but I'd rather just be friends if that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, what about Abel?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/7 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Truly?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Truly."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah ah!! I...I have found love at last! No more lonely days!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/18 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I give you big kiss. Big hug. Big lift!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am so happy... I never imagined I could find love right here at home."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/34 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Who would have thought that you were seducing me all this time?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like it might have been the other way around, but who's counting?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Either way! We have been practicing dating each other all along."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/c-0/15 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But it doesn't feel like practice, really."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/c-0/23 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We have only done what is natural."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This... this is comparatively more disappointing to me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I accept your friendship."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I think you are right."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have been such a wonderful friend to me and I would hate to lose that."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/39 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Thank you for hearing me out, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/47 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Our dating lessons are officially over."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/55 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Next time we meet I hope you will tell me some good news about your love life!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/63/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me too. Thanks, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/63/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It has been honor, friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What about Abel?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you two would be a good match."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hm. I might be thinking so too, but this Abel, he does not seem to ask me to be his lover."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abel is a little shy..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you should ask him?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No, no! I am very much traditional desk built in traditional way! To ask out another? No. This is Table's job. Not mine."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "For now, I repeat."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_joiner/31
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You failed the dating simulator... impressive feat! Keep up the good work."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ready to chat now?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am. You are most kind to wait on me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/48/s/0 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is someone out there who has my heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I do not think it will ever happen for us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Your friendship has allowed me to make peace with this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps I am not meant for heart-stopping love affair."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I think I can be good friend to my friends."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And this is enough."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're talking about Abel, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mon. You can tell me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I... am talking of Abel the Table, yes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-4/15/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-5/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't you just ask him out?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-5/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No! I am very much a traditional desk built in a traditional way! To ask out another, this is Table's job. Not mine."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I... am talking of Abel the Table."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I've got something to say about that..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll be here to support you through your journey to find the one for you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Give up on him. I'm the best one for you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That means much. Thank you, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course. Come on, let's go cheer you up. Maybe lift something?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will lift YOU."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/18 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha lifts you swiftly, tossing you into the air and catching you like an infant. She holds you over her head, grinning."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/26/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "WHOOOAH!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaha! You lift burdens from my shoulders, and I lift you over my shoulders. We are excellent team."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please, do not ask this of me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You mean much to me. But I do not think we share the same kind of feelings for each other."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are like sunshine. And it sounds like in your eyes I am burning flames of passion."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right. But if you don't feel the same way..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You understand, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course. I'm just happy to have you in my life, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What a relief."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaha! You lift my burdens from my shoulders, and I lift you over my shoulders. We are excellent team."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You... cannot decide this on your own."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do not test my friendship in such a manner. This makes me wobble in an ungainly way."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really don't want this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have wobbled."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now I fall."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Here you come, ready to ruin the day of everyone you meet."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Or perhaps you are only so rude to Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell's your problem?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You! You are my problem!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have spent hours of my time trying to help you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And you have spat in my eye at every turn!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have NEVER regretted helping a friend until now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But perhaps this is the problem."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are not my friend. You never were."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That seems needlessly harsh."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never liked you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your loss, weirdo."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "YOU are needlessly harsh!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Leave me now. I have nothing more to say to you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "How lucky for you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Unfortunately for me, I did like you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It seems only one of us is hurt in this relationship."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But no more. Leave me now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/39 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/47
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have nothing more to say to you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No. It is no loss, at all."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But it is <i>your</i> loss."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha is wonderful friend, excellent lover."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But you will never, ever, EVER know this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Leave me now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have not spoken to Abel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Don't look at me like that!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is Abel who must find me anyway!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Speak with him if you insist on bringing us together."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Remind him of table's duty. Sell him on Dasha's many good points."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah... there you are, my beloved."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong, Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/9/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mere, Dasha. Gimme a lift."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/10/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to Realize you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh, nothing... sometimes I just feel as if there's something missing in my life."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But that is not on you. You are my angel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I just wish I knew what is making me feel this way..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear it. Can I cheer you up?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Seeing you is enough."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But hug and kiss might help."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come here, then."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha pulls you into a hug that warms you from head to toe, pressing a soft kiss to your lips."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ahhh... wonderful. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You always calm storm in my mind and heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's my honor, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now go, go! Before I melt into puddle!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-1/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You always know how to make me feel better."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There you are, friend! It is always so good to see you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great to see you too, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh, nothing. I had hoped seeing you might help cheer me up, but..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I suppose it's something I must figure out on my own."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I cannot shake feeling something is missing."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't help?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But this is not your problem. Only Dasha's."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Have a nice day. For both of us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Didn't do enough damage before?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps you are hoping to finish the job?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I live here, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not at all. Can't we just start over? (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Unfortunately for all of us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yikes. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes. A new beginning."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha holds too much on her shoulders to hold onto grudge with you too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let us leave such unpleasantness behind us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/45
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Friends again?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends again."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/4
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hello! You have arrived just in time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh boy."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's about time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Let them talk.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have been trying to complete set for the last twenty minutes but... I am losing count."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "My mind is like wind whirl..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Maybe I could help you keep count?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha drops the weights she was in the middle of lifting with a loud, terrible sound."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/48
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel!? Oh, bozhe moi... I have dropped weights."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/56
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Like insufferable lout at gym!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/64
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Here, let me..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/72
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No no, I will..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/80
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel and Dasha both bend down to pick up the weights, their hands brushing as they do. Their eyes meet, and each pauses, frozen in place."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/107
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Your hands are real soft, you know."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/115
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Like a well-maintained leather saddle."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/123
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I'm not sure this is compliment exactly..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/131
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But you make me blush all the same, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Whew. Alright, alright."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I been dancin' around my feelin's for you for too long now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Feelings? Feelings of... friendship?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I don't know about you, but I ain't never wanted to kiss my friend in an intimate place."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel!?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'm sorry if I'm embarrassin' ya, but I ain't sorry about my feelings."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Dasha... no one gets me like you do."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Nobody else in this house knows how hard it is to carry everyone else's burdens on your shoulders."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/67
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You do it without ever askin' for a thank you. Ya do it just cause it's right."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/75
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And WHILE ya do it, you look so gosh dang gorgeous!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/86
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Like a sunrise made 'a flowers and rainbows."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/94
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh Abel... you really have way with words."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/102
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Like... ah... typewriter... used by dictionary."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/110
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Aw shucks... that's the nicest thing anyone's ever said to me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/118
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "D'you think it'd be alright if I... if I kissed ya?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/126
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I would like nothing more..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/134/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get a room, you two."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/135/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know I'm still here, right?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/136/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Awww."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh! I am so sorry, I... I forgot where I was."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/18
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I intend to."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/34
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I told ya I'm done dancin' around my feelin's. I love you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/45
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...always have."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/56 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-5/23 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/34
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I love you too..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I do, and I'm sorry... I just need to say this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I love you, Dasha. Always have."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Glad you don't mind, but I ain't doin' this for nobody's approval."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I just gotta say one more thing."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I love you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/0 dasha_desk/abel_friend_divert/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And you know what? This human living in this house made it all possible."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/8 dasha_desk/abel_friend_divert/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I noticed your shenanigans getting us together... and I'll be damned if I didn't like it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's amazing. I love you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wasn't expecting that, just wanted to be friends with you, Abel!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "That's the spirit. Always room for one more between all our arms."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...I love you, too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Fine with me!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_friend_divert/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Thank you, friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What does this mean for us, Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so happy for you Dasha... you deserve this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha's heart is big enough to love both of you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "My life will be complete with both of your love."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you still want me too?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Of course! If you will have me..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I could never let you go, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I ain't threatened by nothin'. If Dasha loves you then I'm happy for you both."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "We can all be happy now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I couldn'ta gotten here without your love, you know."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You taught me I deserve to be happy too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And bein' happy for me means havin' both of y'all at my side."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so glad to hear that, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If Abel loves you too then this only makes my heart glad."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To love table whose heart is big enough to love you and I at once... I cannot ask for better."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Thank you, my friend. I could not have done this without your support."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No no, this was all you two. I'm just happy to be here to see it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Thank ya kindly, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Happy days ahead for all of us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! But don't let me keep you two."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You're right. Dasha, if you'd like to... I'd be honored to take ya on a real date."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I would love to..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Thank you again for your support. Abel... let's go."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I tip my hat to ya, friend. See ya around."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And Dasha... wanna love me for bringing you together?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We make a great team, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There you are! The person responsible for my happiness."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/11
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am so happy to have Abel, and so happy to call you friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Come, let me hug you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha throws her arms around you, squeezing you just a little bit too tight."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooof! I think you might have cracked a rib..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/36/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to Realize you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaa, apologies my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am just so grateful."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I hope you are having wonderful day."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's always a wonderful day when I run into you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Take care of yourself, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/10
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "There she is... the prettiest desk in the house!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like it's time for me to hit the old dusty trail."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "'Preciate the privacy, partner."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/3
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There you are! One half of my heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/11
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And here comes the other half now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have both come to see me at once?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am not sure my heart can withstand such happiness."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/35
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It's gonna have to withstand a whole lot more'n both of us comin' to say hi."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/43
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Bozhe moi... I am only humble desk."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/54
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You must take it easy on me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's way more fun to fluster you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Ain't it? I like the cut of your jib."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am truly luckiest desk in world."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're the lucky ones."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Darn tootin'."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Realize? <i>Me</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/17/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/18/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, no problem at all."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Only return to me when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have returned! Does this mean you are ready?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Take your time—I will be here."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Dasha - can you be the one to lift our spirits and make sure this Realization thing works?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay Dasha, let's do one big lift together! Hup!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a desk, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha's impressive muscle is all the more striking when she's given human form—there's a vitality to her now, a warmth and depth that radiate from deep within."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's the same Dasha you've come to know, but this Dasha is <i>human</i>, and now capable of giving you absolutely life-changing hugs."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She doesn't even take a moment to inspect herself or let her transformation sink in before she's charging up to you and lifting you into her arms."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have been realized! I am human!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I can hug now like never before!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel so fulfilled..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is hugging <i>really</i> all you want to do, Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "As do I. Thank you for this gift."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will make you proud... just wait."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Just like that, the energy between the two of you shifts. Dasha draws back just enough to look into your eyes—in hers, you see the promise of a love that's unlike any other... and in her touch you feel your impending ruin."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/11
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is much I want to do with you, beloved... you have only to ask."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm asking now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Then I am doing now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha whisks you away in her strong, loving arms, and that night you are loved as you've never been."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Newly human and now alone together, Dasha shows you her truest, most vulnerable self—she may have once been a desk, but here she's only a woman, soft and loving and deserving of the world."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The dateviators certainly reflected her inner beauty, but there's a depth of connection between you now that can only be built from this kind of tender intimacy."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Still, when the two of you lie in bed together, even as she holds you close she seems at times distracted or even sad."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you try to ask her what's on her mind, she only thanks you for choosing her, for showing up when she needed you most."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Without anyone around to demand Dasha's constant support, she's able to focus on finding what makes her happiest—and she finds she's happiest in the kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha takes great joy in cooking for and feeding others, and she comes by the house often with baked goods and covered dishes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you ask Dasha why she makes so much at a time, she gets that sad look in her eyes again."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I make so much to heal the pain in my heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To fuel my muscles, yes... but they only need so much."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now please... let us eat."
msgstr ""
